### Create devices
POST {{url}}/api/device
Content-Type: application/json

[{
  "name":"Z it starts with z",
  "macAddress": "3B-FB-19-6A-92-61"
}]

### Search devices
GET {{url}}/api/device?orderBy=id&asc=true

### Get Device by id
GET {{url}}/api/device/{{id}}